{
  "title": "Luxurious Creamy Korean Pork Ssam",
  "description": "A cultured and creamy Korean dish featuring rosemary, this one-pot meal is perfect for special occasions, simmered to perfection and served in a ssam form, it is also onion and garlic free.",
  "cuisine": "Korean",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
